{"name":"Hluthvar","status":"ok","title":"Hluthvar","pageId":41145,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Hluthvar\" title=\"Category:Maps of Hluthvar\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Hluthvar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small City</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Western_Heartlands\" title=\"Western Heartlands\">Western Heartlands</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5,668 in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Hluthvar</b> (<small><span style=\"font-variant: small-caps;\">pronounced</span>: /<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/H_as_in_%22halfling%22\" title='H as in \"halfling\"'>h</a><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/E_as_in_%22elf%22\" title='E as in \"elf\"'>ɛ</a>ˈ<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/L_as_in_%22law%22\" title='L as in \"law\"'>l</a><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/U_as_in_%22dungeon%22\" title='U as in \"dungeon\"'>ʌ</a><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Th_as_in_%22strength%22\" title='Th as in \"strength\"'>θ</a><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/V_as_in_%22vision%22\" title='V as in \"vision\"'>v</a><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Ar_as_in_%22bard%22\" title='Ar as in \"bard\"'>ɑːr</a>/ <i>heh-LUTH-var</i><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS1e-CR-p52_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS1e-CR-p52-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></small>) was a walled town on the <a href=\"/wiki/Dusk_Road\" title=\"Dusk Road\">Dusk Road</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sunset_Vale\" title=\"Sunset Vale\">Sunset Vale</a>, east of the <a href=\"/wiki/Reaching_Woods\" title=\"Reaching Woods\">Reaching Woods</a> and west of the <a href=\"/wiki/Sunset_Mountains\" title=\"Sunset Mountains\">Sunset Mountains</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-228_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-228-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Notable_Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Locations</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Taverns_&amp;_Inns\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Taverns &amp; Inns</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Shops\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Shops</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Temples\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Temples</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Notable_Residents\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable Residents</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hluthvar?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Hluthvar was named for a local warrior-hero. It has been said to lie in the shadow of the Darkhold and has long been seen as more of a fortress against the Zhentarim than an actual trading town.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsec